{"id":"48e0b8a78d35938f","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_InnerHorn.md","title":"InnerHorn","display":"InnerHorn","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"InnerHorn","parameters":["X","R","n","k","h"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"InnerHorn"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>X</span><span>R</span><span>n</span><span>k</span><span>h</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：小拟范畴语义。有序参数：<code>X</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>n</code>、<code>k</code>、<code>h</code>。</p>\n<p>仅 0&lt;k&lt;n；不要求唯一填充。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ InnerHorn X R n k h)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists two\n  (exists nn\n    (exists m\n      (exists J\n        (exists sk\n          (exists M\n            (and\n              (@ Num2 two)\n              (and\n                (@ Nat n)\n                (and\n                  (or (= n two) (in two n))\n                  (and\n                    (in k n)\n                    (and\n                      (@ Nonempty k)\n                      (and\n                        (@ Succ n nn)\n                        (and\n                          (@ Succ m n)\n                          (and\n                            (@ Single k sk)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Diff nn sk J)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App X m M)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Map h J M)\n                            (forall i\n                            (implies\n                            (in i J)\n                            (forall j\n                            (implies\n                            (in j J)\n                            (implies\n                            (in i j)\n                            (exists ai\n                            (exists aj\n                            (exists jm\n                            (exists b\n                            (exists c\n                            (and\n                            (@ App h i ai)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App h j aj)\n                            (and (@ Succ jm j) (and (@ SimpFace X R m i aj b) (and (@ SimpFace X R m jm ai c) (= b c)))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"769ef3d3a316871f\" href=\"?note=769ef3d3a316871f\" title=\"ZFC_Diff\">Diff</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b242e5082334b5f2\" href=\"?note=b242e5082334b5f2\" title=\"ZFC_Map\">Map</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fe68ff8d3284eeda\" href=\"?note=fe68ff8d3284eeda\" title=\"ZFC_Nonempty\">Nonempty</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36fc33b3a64f5aa9\" href=\"?note=36fc33b3a64f5aa9\" title=\"ZFC_Num2\">Num2</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6ead27971b185ffe\" href=\"?note=6ead27971b185ffe\" title=\"ZFC_SimpFace\">SimpFace</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"bdbfd129fa484068\" href=\"?note=bdbfd129fa484068\" title=\"ZFC_Single\">Single</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" href=\"?note=1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" title=\"ZFC_Succ\">Succ</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>